{"ticker":"MTD","updated":"2026-11-14T01:15:31Z","profile":{"longName":"Mettler-Toledo International Inc.","shortName":"Mettler-Toledo International, I","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"Switzerland","website":"https://www.mt.com","fullTimeEmployees":16600,"marketCap":34587623424,"trailingPE":37.744953,"forwardPE":32.671707,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.23815,"pegRatio":3.21,"targetMeanPrice":1737.5,"targetHighPrice":1930.0,"targetLowPrice":1200.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.063,"earningsGrowth":0.163,"grossMargins":0.59157,"operatingMargins":0.27818,"profitMargins":0.22248,"totalRevenue":4198469888,"beta":1.171,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1806.58,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":1023.05,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Mettler-Toledo International Inc. manufactures and supplies precision instruments and services in the Americas, Europe, Asia, and internationally. It operates through five segments: U.S. Operations, Swiss Operations, Western European Operations, Chinese Operations, and Other Operations. The company offers laboratory instruments, such as laboratory balances, liquid pipetting solutions, real-time analytics, titrators, pH meters, process analytics sensors and analyzer technologies, density and refractometry instruments, and thermal analysis systems; and other analytical instruments, including UV/VIS spectrophotometers, moisture analyzers, and cell counters, as well as LabX, a laboratory software platform to manage and analyze data generated by its instruments and automate workflows. It also provides industrial instruments comprising industrial weighing instruments and related terminals, automatic dimensional measurement and data capture solutions, vehicle scale systems, industrial software, metal detectors, x-ray systems, checkweighers, and camera-based imaging equipment. In addition, the company offers retail weighing solutions consisting of weighing and software solutions, AI-driven image recognition solutions for fresh goods, and automated packaging and labeling solutions for the meat backroom. The company serves pharmaceutical and biotech companies, independent research organi","summary_zh":"梅特勒-托利多國際公司在美洲、歐洲、亞洲和國際上製造和供應精密儀器並提供服務。它透過五個部門運作：美國業務部門、瑞士業務部門、西歐業務部門、中國業務部門和其他業務部門。該公司提供實驗室儀器，例如實驗室天平、液體移液解決方案、即時分析、滴定儀、pH 計、流程分析感測器和分析技術、密度和折射儀以及熱分析系統；和其他分析儀器，包括紫外線/可見分光光度計、水分分析儀和細胞計數器，以及 LabX，這是一個實驗室軟體平台，用於管理和分析儀器生成的數據並自動化工作儀器。它還提供工業儀器，包括工業稱重儀器和相關終端、自動尺寸測量和數據採集解決方案、車輛衡系統、工業軟體、金屬探測器、X射線系統、檢重秤和基於攝影機的成像設備。此外，該公司還提供零售稱重解決方案，包括稱重和軟體解決方案、人工智慧驅動的新鮮商品圖像識別解決方案以及肉類後台的自動化包裝和標籤解決方案。公司服務製藥和生物技術公司、獨立研究機構","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":1255.39,"h":1270.02,"l":1255.39,"c":1260.13,"v":109700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":1258.5,"h":1282.76,"l":1242.8199,"c":1276.1,"v":124200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":1282.0,"h":1295.22,"l":1260.63,"c":1273.96,"v":177200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":1279.01,"h":1302.6,"l":1279.01,"c":1287.1,"v":116100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":1291.8,"h":1291.8,"l":1263.16,"c":1265.59,"v":231400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":1263.98,"h":1273.83,"l":1252.13,"c":1258.05,"v":119900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":1251.85,"h":1268.74,"l":1245.83,"c":1257.03,"v":145300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":1250.3,"h":1251.66,"l":1232.51,"c":1242.28,"v":151900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":1232.2,"h":1232.2,"l":1199.72,"c":1209.54,"v":164000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":1210.92,"h":1225.61,"l":1200.8,"c":1204.4301,"v":130100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":1215.3,"h":1215.3,"l":1187.8,"c":1191.36,"v":114200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":1190.0699,"h":1231.5699,"l":1190.0699,"c":1227.61,"v":134600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":1227.73,"h":1292.1,"l":1227.73,"c":1289.8199,"v":200500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":1278.4,"h":1302.79,"l":1261.12,"c":1300.54,"v":163000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":1307.48,"h":1327.01,"l":1303.99,"c":1314.04,"v":146200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":1315.08,"h":1346.17,"l":1309.5601,"c":1345.27,"v":155300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":1353.4399,"h":1353.439